Now in the game the player can change skins! A wardrobe was installed on the base (it is outlined with a white stripe). 10 completely [b] free skins [/ b] for the main character were added to the game:
1. Russian man;
2. Biker;
3. Shaolin;
4. Cowboy;
5. Reper;
6. Medic.
7. Specialist in radiation safety;
8. Classic;
9. The officer;
10. The traveler.

Also, a critical error in working with inventory was fixed in the game. Specifically, a problem could sometimes arise when removing an item from a satchel.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/32200705/d12f685e3ccef846564d1d3ea79af75e1aac974a.jpg [/img]

Hello everyone Since the release of the last ad, it has been implemented:
[olist]
[*] New generation of the world. Now it is less resource-intensive, and less problematic. It has become easier to add new game objects to the world generation;
[*] Once again, we changed the day and night in the game. Now she was much more beautiful; 
[*] Added new locations to the game;
[*] Added a new mob, which will only appear on the location "SWAMP", and it has a unique behavior;
[*] Added a new mob, which under the form of player - is beginning to spit poison in him. When approaching it, it explodes and thus poisons the player;
[*] Added a new type of mobs-animals (wolf, elk, bear, wild boar);
[*] Added a unique mob-fat guy. It is huge and can jump and stun the player when landing;
[*] A mob has been added that always carries an explosive barrel with it. If you shoot it, it will explode. Next to this mob it is better not to stand;
[*] The game is implemented concussion/stun. During concussion, the player cannot move, attack, or use items;
[*] In order for the game to be able to add locations of multi-storey buildings, we had to implement the ability to lick/slazit vertical stairs. There were also elevators, in which the player can move on different floors;
[*] Added the ability to break the mob into pieces of meat from the explosion;
[*] Changed walking sounds;
[*] An algorithm for controlling the outgoing sound from objects is implemented;
[*] Added obstacles in the form of a car with an active alarm, when faced with which it will be triggered, and it will run down the zombies.  The car can be blown up;
[*] Visualization of electric shock is implemented;
[*] Worked on the game balance;
[*] Implemented cut scenes before the start of the game, at the end of the game, as well as at the death of the player;
[*] A visual trajectory of the grenade/Molotov cocktail throw appeared;
[*] The player model and its animations have been redesigned.
[/olist]
 In addition to all this, there were still small innovations and improvements. Many bugs have been fixed.

Congratulations on the upcoming year 2020! We really hope to release the game in early access in 2-3 months!

Dear players! Please don't be nervous. The game will be necessarily finalized and released to the store. We don't get to work on the game every day, because the game is developed on enthusiasm (without payment). In addition to developing the game, we have [u]a lot of problems[/u], for example:
 [i] Work in the factory;
   study at University;
   House construction;
   Family;
      And also other problems![/i]
Therefore we ask you to forgive us, because of the next postponement of release. 
Thank you all for your attention! We will be glad if you support us :lunar2019coolpig:
